{"version":1,"content":"<p></p>\n<h2>日本一蘭拉麵出「味覺集中吧檯」</h2>\n<p>日本一蘭拉麵為慶祝經典伴手禮「一蘭拉麵 博多細麵直麵」上市10週年，一蘭推出「味集中吧檯桌上型組合套組」，讓你不用飛到日本，也能在家中重現那個熟悉的單人座位與豚骨香氣。</p>\n<h2>在家還原店舖風味!</h2>\n<p>這是品牌首次推出可將拉麵直接放在套件上享用的商品。套組以店內「味集中吧檯」為藍本，還原左右遮擋視線的隔板、正面的簾幕，以及牆面細節。組裝方式亦相當簡單，不需額外工具，只要按說明把零件逐一插好即可；大約5分鐘便能完成。完成後，你便擁有一個屬於自己的迷你一蘭座位，在家也能體驗「專心吃麵、不被打擾」的儀式感。</p>\n<h2>連加麵提示音都有</h2>\n<p>最值得一讚是套組上的「呼叫按鈕」。只要按下按鈕，便會播放一蘭店內熟悉的喇叭提示音，彷彿店員正準備為你送上加點替玉；從視覺到聽覺，都完整重現一蘭的用餐氛圍。</p>\n<p> <figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438409203244970_17610523636af420dd1d533.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438409203244970_17610523636af420dd1d533.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438409728056436_15386422956af420e3d8f51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438409728056436_15386422956af420e3d8f51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438410812617261_6538093826af420f14e34e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438410812617261_6538093826af420f14e34e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438412456877059_5726929576af420fd04918.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179438412456877059_5726929576af420fd04918.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfl11rNE-rO/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%e6%96%b0%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1-%e4%b8%80%e8%98%ad%e6%8b%89%e9%ba%b5-%e9%86%89%e6%84%9b%e5%93%88%e7%9a%ae-ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8-ww01-3540396/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日本一蘭拉麵出「味覺集中吧檯」 在家還原店舖風味!連加麵提示音都有</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期</a>.</p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.170511+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":524,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:02:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:08:50.988186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418787+00:00","content_hash":"d6abeaf95a9540d7ee727a336e2db3a5272f70eceae5d9c16e8b82f1b04bac58","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 404","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}